# EXPERIMENT 12 – DEVELOP SPRING BOOT TEST CASES FOR THE CONTAINERIZED APPLICATION

## AIM
To develop Spring Boot test cases for the Dockerized Event Registration application.

## THEORY

Spring Boot Test and JUnit are used to write automated test cases.

The Event Registration application runs inside a Docker container.

A separate Spring Boot test project sends HTTP requests to the running application and checks the responses.

In this experiment, Spring Boot is used as the testing client to verify the Node.js application running inside Docker.

**Important:** The Event Registration application is built using Node.js. Spring Boot is used only for testing.

